#: util.py:66
msgid ""
"ESRI Shapefile (zip), GeoPackage, GeoJSON, GML, KML, CSV or XLSX formats are "
"supported. For CSV and XLSX only points are supported, coordinates must be "
"put in lat and lot columns."
msgstr ""
"Se admiten los formatos ESRI Shapefile (zip), GeoPackage, GeoJSON, GML, KML, "
"CSV o XLSX. Para CSV y XLSX solo se admiten puntos, las coordenadas deben "
"colocarse en columnas lat y lot."
